The quest is needed to win, so now is a good time.

Best boots - Almost certainly blessed fireproof +3 boots of speed
but maybe blessed fireproof +3 boots of water walking.

Best gloves - Either blessed rustproof +3 gauntlets of power or
blessed fireproof +3 gauntlets of dexterity.

Best shield - blessed +s shield of reflection if your character
can't #twoweapon, another weapon if your character can #twoweapon.

Best shirt - there are only two kinds and they are about equal.

Best armor - blessed +3 silver dragon scale mail or blessed +3
grey dragon scale mail.  Which you pick effects other choices.

Best cloak - pick one with MC=3 over any with MC=2.  Yes this
means that displacement loses to several others unless you also
use mithril armor instead of dragon mail.

Best defense - good offense ;^)

